<https://w3id.org/leo/onto/health-assessment> a adms:Asset;
  m8g:isReusedBy "https://w3id.org/leo/data/project/LEO"^^xsd:anyURI;
  dct:creator <https://w3id.org/leo/data/private-organization/00944701002>, <https://w3id.org/leo/data/private-organization/06695411006>;
  dct:description "This is the ontology used to model data of HealthData type in the LEO project. Specifically, the ontology represents the data on health assessments concerning both individual animals and so-called farm screenings. The data is acquired through machine-to-machine mechanisms directly from the 'Istituto Zooprofilattico Umbria-Marche'."@en,
    "Questa è l'ontologia usata per modellare i dati di tipo HealthData nel progetto LEO ovvero dati relativi ad accertamenti sanitari che riguardano sia singoli animali che cosiddetti screening aziendali. I dati sono acquisiti in cooperazione applicativa direttamente dall’Istituto Zooprofilattico Umbria-Marche."@it;
  dct:identifier "https://w3id.org/leo/onto/health-assessment";
  dct:issued "2022-11-22T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  dct:language <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG>, <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ITA>;
