<https://w3id.org/leo/onto/lactation-assessment/LactationAssessment> a rdfs:Class;
  rdfs:label "Lactation Assessment"@en, "Controllo Lattazione"@it;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/leo/data/distribution/LACT-JSON-LD>, <https://w3id.org/leo/data/distribution/LACT-RDF-TURTLE>,
    <https://w3id.org/leo/data/distribution/LACT-RDF-XML> .

