  dct:format <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON_LD>;
  dct:title "JSON-LD distribution of the Livestock Farm Description Ontology"@en, "Distribuzione JSON-LD ontologia sulla descrizione dell'azienda d'allevamento"@it;
  dcat:downloadURL "https://www.leo-project.it/Ontologie/livestockfarm-description/latest/livestockfarm-description.jsonld"^^xsd:anyURI .

<https://w3id.org/leo/data/distribution/lfd-RDF-TURTLE> a adms:AssetDistribution;
